{"id":"grano","lemma":"grano","pos":"noun","rank":2120,"glosses":["grain (the seed of various grass food crops)","grain, seed, kernel, bean (a single seed of certain crops)","grain (a single similar particle of various substances)"],"ipa":"/ˈɡɾano/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"granos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-grano.wav","examples":[{"text":"Vaya al grano.","en":"Get to the point!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78006","words":[{"g":"what a ..."},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"¿Podrías ir directamente al grano?","en":"Could you just get straight to the point?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705654","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"directly, firsthand"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Tu respuesta va al grano.","en":"Your answer is to the point.","words":[{"g":"your"},{"g":"reply"},{"g":"okay"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Fui directo al grano.","en":"I didn't beat around the bush.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642089","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"direct"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"No hagas una montaña de un grano de arena.","en":"Don't make a mountain out of a molehill.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611069","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"mountain"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"sand, gravel"}]}]}